/*
    A chain whose first call waits: waiter:GetHolder(5):GetValue(). The
    object GetHolder returns must be waited for before GetValue is called
    on it, so the await goes around the first call, not the whole chain.
*/
class Main
    action Main
        Waiter waiter
        output "chain: " + waiter:GetHolder(5):GetValue()
        Holder holder = waiter:GetHolder(6)
        output "in two steps: " + holder:GetValue()
    end
end
